flowchart TD
  Q([Natural-language question]):::ext
  WS[("Workspaces<br/>12 curated domain collections<br/>plus custom ones")]:::store
  IA["Intent agent<br/>picks workspaces"]:::llm
  TA["Table agent<br/>proposes tables"]:::llm
  U{{"User confirms tables"}}:::human
  CP["Column-prune agent<br/>strips irrelevant columns"]:::llm
  GEN["Generate SQL<br/>GPT-4 Turbo (128K window)"]:::llm
  OUT([SQL query]):::code
  WHY["Why pruning: schemas of 200+ columns<br/>(40-60K tokens) blew the prototype's 32K window"]:::risk
  EV["Eval: golden set of logged questions<br/>vanilla (end-to-end) vs decoupled flows"]:::code

  Q --> IA
  WS -.->|narrow retrieval| IA
  IA -->|selected workspaces| TA
  TA -->|candidate tables| U
  U -->|confirmed tables| CP
  WHY -.-> CP
  CP -->|pruned schemas| GEN
  GEN --> OUT
  EV -.->|scores intent, tables,<br/>execution, similarity| OUT
